   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Cinematic teal: very dark median (~51), teal-green shadows and mids (21,26,24 / 108,112,96), green-tinted highlights (208,212,196), saturation 0.36, warm filmic skin (hue 29) against cool surroundings. Best for: Dramatic low-key portraits, moody night and interior frames, grooms and black-tie, cinematic pre-wedding films/stills. Not for bright pastel daytime weddings.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
